# (site/_audit.html and site/_settings-audit.html used to be ignored here as
#  "local, dev-only". They are tracked now, alongside site/_overlay-audit.html
#  which always was: both of them hard-coded the board's screen as 1920x1080,
#  which is where the repo's belief that a Board Pro has 1080px of height came
#  from. An untracked harness is one that arrives back on the next clone with
#  the wrong number in it, and correcting them is worth nothing if it does.)

